---
---
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-image-wrap">
        <img src="/images/repair-work.jpg" alt="Josh repairing a lawn mower engine" class="about-img" />
        <div class="about-badge">
          <span class="badge-number">100%</span>
          <span class="badge-label">No Fix, No Pay Guarantee</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">A FATHER &amp; SON<br/> <span>TEAM WITH A MISSION</span></h2>
        <p>
          Curb-It<sup>2</sup> started with a simple idea: too many perfectly fixable lawn mowers
          end up at the curb, destined for the landfill, just because something small went wrong.
          We decided to do something about it.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
          We're a local East Markham father and son team. Our son Josh discovered a knack for small
          engine repair early on, and what started as rescuing discarded mowers off the curb became
          a real business. Now we apply that same passion to keeping <em>your</em> mower running right.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
          We offer professional-grade lawn mower repair at honest prices — weeknights and weekends,
          by appointment. And if we can't fix it? <strong>You pay nothing.</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="about-values">
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">♻️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Save the Planet</strong>
              <p>Repairable equipment stays out of landfills.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">💰</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Save Your Money</strong>
              <p>Repair beats replacement every time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">🏆</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Guaranteed Work</strong>
              <p>If we don't fix it, you don't pay. Period.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-green" style="margin-top:2rem;">Book Your Repair →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: white;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
    height: 520px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .about-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1.5rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(244,124,32,0.4);
  }

  .badge-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .badge-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    max-width: 100px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-values {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .value-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .value strong {
    font-weight: 800;
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .value p {
    font-size: 0.88rem !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-img { height: 320px; }

    .about-badge {
      bottom: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
